      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Removing several decisions opens many possible reconnections.\nOne repair can reorganize multiple routes while retaining fragments.\nThe network explores this space by choosing connections in sequence.",
      "originalText": "Removing several decisions opens many possible reconnections.\nOne repair can reorganize multiple routes while retaining fragments.\nThe network explores this space by choosing connections in sequence.",
