      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Generate incomplete solutions using a specific destroy operator.\nSample a sequence of repairs; compute the added travel cost.\nREINFORCE + a learned critic train the policy to lower that cost.\nNo optimal-route labels are required; models specialize to the\ntraining instance distribution and the chosen destroy operator.",
      "originalText": "Generate incomplete solutions using a specific destroy operator.\nSample a sequence of repairs; compute the added travel cost.\nREINFORCE + a learned critic train the policy to lower that cost.\nNo optimal-route labels are required; models specialize to the\ntraining instance distribution and the chosen destroy operator.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
