      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Start from a greedy feasible solution.\nSelect a destroy/repair pair -> destroy -> neural repair -> score.\nUse the search acceptance rule; keep track of the best solution.\nRepeat until the search budget ends.\nThe repair model weights stay fixed during this search.",
      "originalText": "Start from a greedy feasible solution.\nSelect a destroy/repair pair -> destroy -> neural repair -> score.\nUse the search acceptance rule; keep track of the best solution.\nRepeat until the search budget ends.\nThe repair model weights stay fixed during this search.",
