      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Maintain a batch of solutions for the same routing instance.\nPick operator pairs uniformly at random; repair the batch.\nSimulated annealing can accept worsening candidates.\nReset part of the batch to the current solution; retain other paths.\nCool and reheat the temperature; separately preserve the best.",
      "originalText": "Maintain a batch of solutions for the same routing instance.\nPick operator pairs uniformly at random; repair the batch.\nSimulated annealing can accept worsening candidates.\nReset part of the batch to the current solution; retain other paths.\nCool and reheat the temperature; separately preserve the best.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
